{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-420","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]被解密","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName] Decoded"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","start":"first_contact.420","chapters":3,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"尽管十分困难，我们还是设法破解了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]所使用语言，从而使初步的沟通成为可能。他们似乎自称是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。不可避免地，所有交流只能借助于专门针对其语言的通信系统。\n\n任何试图与他们进行流利的沟通的人都似乎绕不开这个问题，但[This.Owner.GetResearchers]有不同看法。在他的鼓动下，鉴于资金仍有剩余，他们起草了一份提案，意图将这次成功行动的经验应用到更广泛的场合中。他们相信，通过对这里使用的软件","en":"Although it proved a considerable challenge, we have managed to decode the form of communication used by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] sufficiently to establish preliminary contact. It seems that they call themselves the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. "},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.420","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"special_projects:UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"first_contact.420.A","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:7505"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"first_contact.422","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:74"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.420","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]被解密","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName] Decoded"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管十分困难，我们还是设法破解了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]所使用语言，从而使初步的沟通成为可能。他们似乎自称是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。不可避免地，所有交流只能借助于专门针对其语言的通信系统。\n\n任何试图与他们进行流利的沟通的人都似乎绕不开这个问题，但[This.Owner.GetResearchers]有不同看法。在他的鼓动下，鉴于资金仍有剩余，他们起草了一份提案，意图将这次成功行动的经验应用到更广泛的场合中。他们相信，通过对这里使用的软件进行微调，他们将能够构建出他们所称的“通用翻译器”，只要提供足够的信息，就能为任何语言进行同声传译。","en":"Although it proved a considerable challenge, we have managed to decode the form of communication used by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] sufficiently to establish preliminary contact. It seems that they call themselves the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. Inevitably, communication can only happen with the help of communication systems specifically tuned to their language.\n\nThis would appear to be problematic for hopes of fluent conversation with them, but our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] see it differently. Buoyed by their success and still benefiting from the extra funding we provided them, they have drawn up a proposal to consolidate our learnings from this experience into something that will be of generally applicable use. They believe that, by fine-tuning the software used here, they will be able to build what they are calling a \"universal translator\", which - if provided with enough information - will be able to instantaneously suggest translations for phrases uttered in any given language."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.420.A","label":{"zh":"无限的沟通机会尽在掌控！","en":"Unlimited communication possibilities are within our grasp!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:7505","story":"event-first-contact-420"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12901","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,